<gpx version="1.1" creator="SkipperCast" xmlns="http://www.topografix.com/GPX/1/1"><metadata><name>SC26-128-A habitat research</name><desc>WGS84 coordinates. Habitat research; tracks show outlines and structure alignments, not navigation routes. Check current rules and charted hazards.</desc></metadata><wpt lat="35.501521" lon="-121.069782"><name>SC26-128-A</name><cmt>SC26-128</cmt><desc>Point Estero rough reef Mapped rough-rock high; 11.6 m relief across 210 m. Terrain A 79/100; not catch probability. Center 91 ft; nearby 77–115 ft MLLW. Survey-derived habitat candidate; no verified catch at this coordinate. No verified charter identity match in the reviewed AIS sample; no AIS-confirmed hotspot. Survey 2008; screen 2026-09-20. About 757 m from screened closed/access-restricted area; plan entire drift clear. Check current regulations, closures, conditions and sounder depths.</desc><link href="https://doi.org/10.5066/P9ZSTUK1"/><sym>Fishing Area</sym></wpt><trk><name>SC-AREA-102</name><desc>Partial nearby mapped rough-rock/bedrock footprint, clipped within 350 m of retained targets and by depth/closure screening; not the complete reef or an individual pile.</desc><trkseg><trkpt lat="35.503788113918915" lon="-121.06779871597502"/><trkpt lat="35.50377382551309" lon="-121.07253966225183"/><trkpt lat="35.503063465090904" lon="-121.07321811461078"/><trkpt lat="35.50216054666307" lon="-121.07312944241083"/><trkpt lat="35.50207395196496" lon="-121.073352000057"/><trkpt lat="35.50171348876358" lon="-121.0733606113379"/><trkpt lat="35.50116927294713" lon="-121.07315312587544"/><trkpt lat="35.500891882461254" lon="-121.07271878219731"/><trkpt lat="35.500621535110184" lon="-121.07272524251267"/><trkpt lat="35.50062505681545" lon="-121.07294564305798"/><trkpt lat="35.50017447780951" lon="-121.07295640882965"/><trkpt lat="35.500089643702715" lon="-121.07328916063193"/><trkpt lat="35.49954190640731" lon="-121.07286128170645"/><trkpt lat="35.49880336749621" lon="-121.07177652923198